Regenerate with: git diff --abbrev=7 archive/pre-reset-2026-10-10 -- src/lib/store/db.ts (keep this header above it).

D075 (founder's choice, chat 26 Nov 2026; K-124 part b; wiki/decisions/D075-session-id-on-orders.md): `PreorderRow` gains
`ph_session_id?: string | null`, the PostHog session id the order remembers (migration 0005, applied by hand before the code
deploys). It is a TYPE only: no query, no client option and no function in the file changes. It is optional on purpose: the
tests that build a whole row by hand (a guard, three store tests and a fixture) predate the column, and a required field would
force edits to all of them for a value none of them uses. `markPaid` reads the order with `select("*")`, so the column reaches `purchase_confirmed` with no
change to fulfil.ts.

diff --git a/src/lib/store/db.ts b/src/lib/store/db.ts
